# step13.rules - primary/13_set_max_availability.sh
# The validation prompts fire only on an unhealthy configuration: a verified build must not see them
Continue despite broker warnings\?\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	n	fail
Continue anyway despite validation warnings\?\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	n	fail
Continue despite archive destination errors\?\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	n	fail
Proceed with protection mode change\?\nDo you want to proceed\? \[y/N\]:	y
